#: source/development/static-analysis.md:1
msgid "Static Analysis"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:3
msgid ""
"Nix uses [clang-tidy](https://clang.llvm.org/extra/clang-tidy/) for static "
"analysis of C++ code. This helps catch bugs, enforce coding standards, and "
"maintain code quality."
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:6
msgid "Running clang-tidy locally"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:8
msgid "To run clang-tidy on the entire codebase in the development shell:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:16
msgid "This will analyze all C++ source files and report any warnings."
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:18
msgid "To automatically apply fixes for certain warnings:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:24
msgid "**Warning**"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:26
msgid ""
"Review the changes before committing, as automatic fixes may not always be "
"correct."
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:28
msgid "CI integration"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:30
msgid ""
"clang-tidy runs automatically on every pull request via GitHub Actions. The "
"CI job builds `.#hydraJobs.clangTidy.x86_64-linux` which:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:33
msgid "Builds all components with debug mode (for faster compilation)"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:34
msgid "Runs clang-tidy on each component"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:35
msgid "Fails if any warnings are found (warnings are treated as errors)"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:37
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:39
msgid ""
"The clang-tidy configuration is in `.clang-tidy` at the repository root "
"(symlinked from `nix-meson-build-support/common/clang-tidy/.clang-tidy`)."
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:41
msgid "Suppressing warnings"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:43
msgid "If a warning is a false positive, you can suppress it in several ways:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:45
msgid "**Inline suppression** (preferred for specific cases):"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:47
msgid "// NOLINTBEGIN(bugprone-some-check)\n"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:49
msgid "// NOLINTEND(bugprone-some-check)\n"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:51
msgid "Or for a single line:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:53
msgid "// NOLINT(bugprone-some-check)\n"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:56
msgid ""
"**Configuration file** (for project-wide suppression): Add the check to the "
"disabled list in `.clang-tidy`:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:59
msgid "Checks"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:60
msgid "-bugprone-some-check  # Reason for disabling\n"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:63
msgid "**Check options** (for configuring check behavior):"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:65
msgid "CheckOptions"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:66
msgid "bugprone-reserved-identifier.AllowedIdentifiers"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:66
msgid "'__some_identifier'"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:69
msgid "Adding new checks"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:71
msgid "To enable additional checks:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:73
msgid "Edit `nix-meson-build-support/common/clang-tidy/.clang-tidy`"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:74
msgid "Add the check to the `Checks` list"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:75
msgid "Run clang-tidy locally to see the impact"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:76
msgid "Fix any new warnings or disable specific sub-checks if needed"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:78
msgid "Custom clang-tidy plugin"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:80
msgid ""
"The Nix project includes infrastructure for custom clang-tidy checks in `src/"
"clang-tidy-plugin/`. These checks can enforce Nix-specific coding patterns "
"that aren't covered by standard clang-tidy checks."
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:83
msgid "To add a new custom check:"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:85
msgid "Add the check implementation in `src/clang-tidy-plugin/`"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:86
msgid "Register it in `nix-clang-tidy-checks.cc`"
msgstr ""

#: source/development/static-analysis.md:87
msgid "Enable it in `.clang-tidy` with the `nix-` prefix"
msgstr ""
